<title>USA: Enviro-Recovery Inc CEO Nevard resigns.</title>
<headline>Enviro-Recovery Inc CEO Nevard resigns.</headline>
<dateline>ASHLAND, Wis. 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Enviro-Recovery Inc said on Tuesday that its transitional vice chairman and chief executive, Roger Nevard, had resigned from his offices to pursue other business opportunities.</p>
<p>The company, which recovers and processes virgin timber from the bottom of the Great Lakes, did not name a successor to Nevard but said it was considering several candidates.</p>
<p>Nevard will continue to serve on Enviro-Recovery's board of directors, a company spokesman said.</p>
</text>
